From: Martin Fick <mfick@codeaurora.org>
Date: Tue, 15 Jan 2013 10:06:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add Change specific tokens to ChangeDahsboards

Add the following tokens to be used for ChangeDashboards:

 ${branch}
 ${change.id}
 ${change.key}
 ${project}
 ${ref}
 ${subject}
 ${topic}

Change-Id: Id38c35de2535d45b3d0488cf0fb84bcd582183d1
---
